<title>USA: Buckle August same store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Buckle August same store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>KEARNEY, Neb. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buckle Inc said Thursday that comparable store sales for the four-week period ended August 31 were up 19.4 percent from a year ago.</p>
<p>Total sales for the four-week period increased 31.0 percent to $26.6 million from $20.3 million.  </p>
<p>Buckle said net sales year-to-date increased 24.1 percent to $109.8 million from $88.5 million a year ago. Same store sales for the year-to-date period were up 14.8 percent from the 1995 period.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
